@startuml creator-master-resolution-sequence
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Figure 4.3.3.2.3 Master Creator Resolution Sequence Diagram
hide footbox
autonumber
participant CreatorClaimOAuthController as API
participant CreatorClaimResolutionService as Service
participant CreatorRepository as Creators
participant CreatorMasterRepository as Masters
API -> Service : resolveClaim(platform, code, state, actor)
activate Service
Service -> Creators : findLockedById(targetCreatorId)
Creators --> Service : target Creator or lookup error
alt <U+005B>verification or ownership check fails<U+005D>
  note over Service : Follow the claim failure path in §3.4.
else <U+005B>claim can be linked<U+005D>
  Service -> Masters : findByUserId(claimantUser.id)
  Masters --> Service : existing CreatorMaster or empty
  opt <U+005B>no CreatorMaster for claimant<U+005D>
    Service -> Masters : save(new CreatorMaster)
    Masters --> Service : saved CreatorMaster
  end
  Service -> Creators : save(creator) with master and AUTHORIZED source
end
Service --> API : OAuthCallbackResponse or mapped error
deactivate Service
@enduml
